OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist avoids jail after woman
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who caused the death of a
OL,7,Fwoman in Lincolnshire when he crossed
OL,8,Fon to the wrong side of the road while
OL,9,Fhe was distracted has been given a
OL,10,Fsuspended jail sentence.
OL,12,FCalum Drake, 22, from Stratton
OL,13,FStrawless, near Norwich, was travelling
OL,14,Fsouth on the A15 near Leasingham when
OL,15,Fhe failed to take a left-hand bend and
OL,16,Fdrove straight on.
OL,18,FHis Citroen C3 hit a Kia Picanto being
OL,19,Fdriven by 22-year-old Hannah Curtis,
OL,20,Ffrom Lincoln. She died 16 days later.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
